Docs: default signing, the built-in key, the clean-room exception, and the hardware result.

Updates the signing and clean-room documentation to match 04: E-AC-3 Atmos
signs automatically with the built-in DEE key, and that key plus its
authenticated-region layout are not clean-room (recovered from DEE, not a
standard). Records the hardware result: an Apple TV 4K on tvOS 27.0
reconstructs the objects of a default-signed stream and mutes the same stream
with one tag bit flipped. Apply after 04-default-signing.

